	(text "CANDLE CHANNEL (one per candle; channel 5 is the shamash)\npwm: one Pico PWM line per candle. On the driver board it sets the laser current and,\nthrough an activity detector, switches the atomizer (on while PWM pulses are present).\nDRV (4-pin cable to the driver board): 1 LASER_RAIL, 2 GND, 3 PWM, 4 +5V (atomizer supply)."
